# New Tower artwork archive

When creating, generating, or installing any image for the New Tower / Site project:

1. **Always save a copy** to `/Users/jonmcmillion/Documents/Code/NewTower/NewTowerArtWork/`, whether or not the image ships on the live site.
2. **Preserve structure** under that folder when it helps (e.g. `img/app/`, `img/themes/`, `img/roadmap-intersection.jpg`). Use a clear subfolder for one-offs or rejected drafts (e.g. `img/drafts/` or `assets/`) if they would clutter live paths.
3. **After GenerateImage** (or any new asset in `.cursor/projects/.../assets/`), copy the file into `NewTowerArtWork` before or when installing to `Site/img/`.
4. **Do not skip** because an image was rejected, experimental, or only shown in chat — archive it anyway.

The canonical site paths remain under `Site/img/`; `NewTowerArtWork` is the master artwork backup.
